    "sections": {
        "description": "Storecraft Furniture is a modern WordPress theme designed for furniture stores, home decor shops, interior studios, sofa and mattress retailers, and lifestyle home brands. Powered by WooCommerce, the theme provides everything you need to create a professional furniture store with a clean shopping experience. Display featured products, new arrivals, living room collections, bedroom sets, product categories, and best-selling items in an elegant, user-friendly layout. Built with performance and flexibility in mind, Storecraft Furniture features a fully responsive design that looks stunning on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme is lightweight, fast-loading, and developed according to WordPress coding standards. It supports the WordPress Block Editor (Gutenberg) and works seamlessly with popular plugins such as WooCommerce, Contact Form 7, WPForms, and Elementor. Storecraft Furniture includes easy customization options through the WordPress Customizer. Whether you're launching a furniture showroom, home decor boutique, lighting store, or interior accessories shop, Storecraft Furniture provides a flexible and professional foundation for your online store."
    },
